Hi folks.

I'm about to start a rather ambitious project:  a set of NetHack Hints
designed to help out the newbie/never ascended types.  I know about
the WCST Spoilers.  These documents will be designed not to be pure
spoilers, per se, but rather to give both information and suggestions
on how to go about playing the game and staying alive.

The first document is entitled "Armor" and goes into the AC values of
suits and the details of some of the miscellaneous armor in the game.

If you would like to get a copy, or put on the "mailing list" for
future Hints, just email me at d_jaracz@oz.plymouth.edu  If you want
to help me compile stuff (i.e. correct my mistakes :) that help would
be greatly appreciated.

Dave

P.S.  In case you're wondering, I currently play on 3.1.3, and have played
NetHack for about three years.


